\end{equation}
tensored with the specified coboundary map $\mathfrak o_\mathfrak s\to\mathfrak o_\mathfrak t$ (plus the internal differential).  The fact that this differential squares to zero follows from Lemma \ref{celllikelocalstructure} and the compatibility of the coboundary maps $\mathfrak o_\mathfrak s\to\mathfrak o_\mathfrak t$ with the geometric boundary maps $\mathfrak o_{(X_I^\mathrm{reg})^{\leq\mathfrak t}}\to\mathfrak o_{(X_I^\mathrm{reg})^{\leq\mathfrak s}}$.

