+\mathsf{PT}_{\exp_{u_\alpha}\zeta\to u_\alpha}\Biggl[D_{\alpha,y,\zeta}\Biggl(\frac d{da}\biggr|_{\begin{smallmatrix}a=\zeta\cr\dot a=\xi\end{smallmatrix}}\Bigl(\exp_{\exp_{u_\alpha}\zeta}^{-1}\exp_{u_\alpha}a\Bigr)\oplus\operatorname{proj}_E\xi\Biggr)\Biggr]
