where $f_i:[0,6S_i]\to[0,6S]$ is defined as follows:
\begin{align}
f_i(s):=&\begin{cases}
s&s\leq S-2\cr
s-3S_i+3S&3S_i-2S+2\leq s\leq 3S_i+2S-2\cr
s-6S_i+6S&6S_i-S+2\leq s\cr
