f_i([S-2,3S_i-2S+2])&\subseteq[S-2,S+2]\\
f_i([3S_i+2S-2,6S_i-S+2])&\subseteq[5S-2,5S+2]
\end{align}
and is smooth with absolutely bounded derivatives of all orders.  More informally, $f_i$ is smooth and matches up $[0,S-2],[S+2,5S-2],[5S+2,6S]\subseteq[0,6S]$ with corresponding intervals of the same length inside $[0,6S_i]$, symmetrically.

